<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>LEGO® GENEVA: 제네바 6대 랜드마크 레고 브릭 모션그래픽</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="./css/style.css" />
</head>
<body>
  <div id="viewport-container">
    <!-- 3D WebGL LEGO Diorama Canvas -->
    <canvas id="webgl-canvas"></canvas>

    <!-- 2D Broadcast Motion Graphic Callout & Telemetry Overlay Canvas -->
    <canvas id="mg-overlay-canvas"></canvas>

    <!-- Subtle Studio Vignette -->
    <div class="broadcast-vignette"></div>

    <!-- Top Broadcast Header Bar -->
    <header class="hud-header">
      <div class="brand-cluster">
        <div class="lego-badge">
          <span class="lego-stud-dot"></span>
          <span>LEGO®</span>
        </div>
        <div class="brand-titles">
          <span class="brand-kicker">GENEVA ARCHITECTURE MOTION GRAPHIC</span>
          <h1 class="brand-main">제네바 레고 브릭 시티 · 6대 랜드마크</h1>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="header-controls">
        <div class="telemetry-pill">
          <span class="rec-dot"></span>
          <span>LIVE BRICKS</span>
          <strong id="total-bricks-readout">8,420 BRICKS</strong>
        </div>

        <button id="btn-rebuild" class="ctrl-btn primary-action" title="현재 랜드마크 브릭 조립 모션 재생 (단축키 R)">
          <span>🧱</span>
          <span class="btn-label">브릭 조립 모션</span>
        </button>

        <button id="btn-stopmotion" class="ctrl-btn" title="레고 무비 스타일 12 FPS 스톱모션 프레임 전환">
          <span>🎞️</span>
          <span class="btn-label">12 FPS 스톱모션</span>
        </button>

        <button id="btn-isolate" class="ctrl-btn" title="전체 도시 연결 뷰 / 현재 랜드마크 단독 포커스 전환">
          <span>🔍</span>
          <span class="btn-label">전체 시티 연결 뷰</span>
        </button>

        <div class="lighting-group" role="group" aria-label="조명 모드">
          <button class="light-btn active" data-light="day">주간</button>
          <button class="light-btn" data-light="sunset">노을</button>
          <button class="light-btn" data-light="night">야경</button>
        </div>

        <button id="btn-audio" class="ctrl-btn" title="레고 브릭 사운드 & 배경 신스 사운드트랙">
          <span>🔊</span>
          <span class="btn-label">사운드 OFF</span>
        </button>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Lower-Third Kinetic Typography Landmark Information Card -->
    <aside id="landmark-card" class="landmark-card">
      <div class="card-top-row">
        <span id="chapter-code" class="chapter-code-badge">GENEVA · CH</span>
        <span class="brick-spec-badge">
          <span class="lego-stud-dot"></span>
          <span id="chapter-brick-count">8,420 LEGO PCS</span>
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="card-title-row">
        <h2 id="card-title-ko" class="card-title-ko">제네바 레고 시티 전체 조망</h2>
        <span id="card-title-fr" class="card-title-fr">GENÈVE EN BRIQUES LEGO®</span>
      </div>
      <p id="card-subtitle" class="card-subtitle">
        레만 호수를 중심으로 펼쳐진 제네바 6대 랜드마크 디오라마
      </p>
      <p id="card-desc" class="card-desc">
        올드타운의 성 피에르 대성당부터 140m 제트 분수, 코르나뱅 중앙역, 유엔 유럽본부, 플라스 드 뇌브, 바스티옹 공원까지 하나의 거대한 레고 브릭 시티로 연결된 모션그래픽입니다.
      </p>
    </aside>

    <!-- Bottom Interactive Chapter Selector & Timeline Scrubber Dock -->
    <footer class="timeline-dock">
      <div id="chapter-tabs" class="chapter-Grid"></div>

      <div class="scrubber-row">
        <button id="btn-prev" class="transport-btn" title="이전 랜드마크">◀</button>
        <button id="btn-play-pause" class="transport-btn" title="재생 / 일시정지 (Space)">❚❚</button>
        <button id="btn-next" class="transport-btn" title="다음 랜드마크">▶</button>

        <div id="scrubber-track" class="scrubber-track" title="타임라인 이동">
          <div id="scrubber-fill" class="scrubber-fill"></div>
        </div>

        <div id="timecode-readout" class="timecode-readout">00:00:00 / 01:06:00</div>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </div>

  <!-- Local Vendor & Modular LEGO Motion Graphic Scripts -->
  <script src="./vendor/three.min.js"></script>
  <script src="./js/lego-engine.js"></script>
  <script src="./js/geneva-landmarks.js"></script>
  <script src="./js/motion-director.js"></script>
  <script src="./js/app.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
